      {
        "id": 105387,
        "name": "Koga",
        "username": "Koga",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-01T02:47:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hopefully they can&nbsp;release an errata pack like they did with SotM, though it might not be till the 2nd printing. It's mistakes like this that were easy to miss when looking at proofs as you didn't know what was on the other side unless you looked it up from playtest copies and believe most were looking for spelling/grammar errors or things like symbols missing something but they were only looking at each card, not both together. They tend to list the cards in aplabetical order so you couldn't easily match up what each card's back was unless you were specifically looking for it.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
